#12135
Ixquit's Supplies~
The room is engulfed in the smell of incense and burning leaves.  The shop
walls are lined with magic items as well as other basic items a traveller
would need.   A young wolfen maid is working behind the counter, organizing
several scrolls and spell books.
~
0 0 0
D2
Exit description~
~
