#12142
The Port Lookout~
This massive tower looks far out over the ocean and the entire docks of the
city.  The militia keep a close eye out for any trouble and keep a careful eye
on the Zanzen forces that sometimes dock looking for mercenaries and slaves.
You can see the rich land of rivers, jungles, and forests spread out to the
south of the great city.
~
0 0 1
D5
Exit description~
~
