#12146
The Altar Of Neutrality~
This small and humble temple is dedicated to an unnamed god or goddess of
neutrality.  You feel safe as you have ever felt, comforted by the deep magiks
and the sanctity of the altar.  This would be an excellent place to relax
after such a long journey.
~
